{
  "title": "Gamercoms — drift",
  "uid": "gamercoms-drift",
  "tags": [
    "gamercoms"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 0,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Datakälla",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "loki",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "regex": "/^(?!.*alert-state-history).*$/"
      },
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Tjänst",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": {
          "label": "service_name",
          "refId": "svc",
          "type": 1
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "reqid",
        "label": "reqId",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Fel i perioden",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service\"} | json | msg=\"request\" | route != \"\" | level=\"error\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null",
                "result": {
                  "text": "0",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Varningar i perioden",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service\"} | json | msg=\"request\" | route != \"\" | level=\"warn\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null",
                "result": {
                  "text": "0",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Fel och varningar över tid",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (level) (count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service\"} | json | msg=\"request\" | route != \"\" | level=~\"error|warn\" [$__auto]))",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{level}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "error"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "warn"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Vad gick fel — felorsaker",
      "description": "En rad per felorsak. \"fel\" är felmeddelandet, \"anrop\" är det interna anrop som misslyckades (t.ex. backend → bot-api). Rader loggade före uppdateringen saknar orsak.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "expr": "topk(20, sum by (service_name, route, error, upstream_path) (count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service\"} | json | msg=\"request\" | level=\"error\" | label_format error=`{{ if .error }}{{ .error }}{{ else }}okänt (loggat före 2026-10-21){{ end }}` [$__range])))"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "labelsToFields",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "antal",
              "service_name": "tjänst",
              "Value #A": "antal",
              "err_message": "fel",
              "error": "fel",
              "upstream_path": "anrop"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "fields": {},
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "antal",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Senaste fel",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "{service_name=~\"$service\"} | json | msg=\"request\" | level=\"error\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "id": 5,
      "description": "En rad per misslyckat anrop. Klicka på raden: \"error\" är orsaken, \"upstream_*\" säger vilket internt anrop som föll (sökväg, status, timeout). Stack trace: klistra in reqId överst."
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Följ en request (klistra in reqId överst)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "{service_name=~\".+\"} |= \"$reqid\" | json | reqId != \"\" | reqId = \"$reqid\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 38
      },
      "id": 6,
      "description": "Alla rader, från alla tjänster, för ett och samma anrop. Backend skickar sitt reqId vidare till bot-api, så ett fel som började i bot-api syns här tillsammans med backend-raden."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Värst drabbade routes",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Rader utan route är anrop mot sökvägar som inte finns — oftast sårbarhetsskannrar.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (route, status, service_name) (count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service\"} | json | msg=\"request\" | route != \"\" | level=~\"error|warn\" [$__range])))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "labelsToFields",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "antal",
              "service_name": "tjänst",
              "Value #A": "antal",
              "err_message": "fel"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "fields": {},
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "antal",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 48
      },
      "id": 7
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Svarstid p95",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.95, {service_name=~\"$service\"} | json | durationMs != \"\" | unwrap durationMs | __error__=\"\" [$__auto]) by (service_name)",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 57
      },
      "id": 8
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Senaste varningar (utan skannerbottar)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "{service_name=~\"$service\"} | json | msg=\"request\" | route != \"\" | level=\"warn\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 65
      },
      "id": 9,
      "description": "4xx från riktiga routes. Anrop mot sökvägar som inte finns (bottar som letar efter .env osv.) är bortfiltrerade."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Hur man läser felen",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Så hittar du vad som gick fel**\n\n1. *Vad gick fel* visar felen grupperade: meddelandet (`fel`) och vilket internt anrop som föll (`anrop`).\n2. I *Senaste fel*, klicka på en rad. `error` är orsaken. `upstream_path`, `upstream_status` och `upstream_code` säger vilket anrop till en annan tjänst som misslyckades; `ECONNABORTED` betyder timeout. `bodyKeys` visar vilka fält anropet skickade, men aldrig värdena.\n3. Vill du se stack trace eller vad bot-api gjorde: kopiera `reqId` till rutan **reqId** överst. *Följ en request* visar hela anropet i alla tjänster.\n\nOm allt är tomt: kontrollera att **Datakälla** är `grafanacloud-…-logs`."
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 74
      },
      "id": 10
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Diagnostik — råa rader, inga filter",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "{service_name=~\".+\"}",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 80
      },
      "id": 11
    }
  ]
}
